From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Antheas Kapenekakis <lkml@antheas.dev>
Date: Wed, 30 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] platform: arm64: add Galaxy Book4 Edge EC platform
 driver

The Samsung Galaxy Book4 Edge reports its battery and AC adapter through
its ENE KB9058 embedded controller, not through the ADSP, whose firmware
has no battery service.

Add a driver for the EC mailbox that reports the battery and AC
adapter, sets the charger input limit the USB-C driver negotiates,
controls the keyboard backlight and its hotkey, and offers the EC's fan
policies as platform profiles.

Signed-off-by: Antheas Kapenekakis <lkml@antheas.dev>
[birk: the state of drivers/platform/arm64/samsung-galaxybook-ec.c and
 its binding at anatase-org/patchwork 00dbccf77911, squashing fb9ad2210fa and
 62cdef60193; MAINTAINERS left out]
Signed-off-by: Birk Skyum <birk.skyum@pm.me>
---
