+	  the ENE KB9058 EC mailbox, and handles the keyboard backlight
+	  brightness hotkey and fan policy platform profiles.
+
+	  To compile this driver as a module, choose M here: the module
+	  will be called samsung-galaxybook-ec.
+
 endif # ARM64_PLATFORM_DEVICES
